   "id": 1799380,
   "key_id": "3EB03B6F798511C0D3BBFD",
   "ts_ms": 1781061855000,
   "ts_iso": "2026-06-10T03:24:15+00:00",
   "from_me": true,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 1,
   "text": "hi wes \nim ivan \nkiki passed me your whatsapp contact \n\nfeel free to pass me any files \ncurrenty im playing with the blender 3d funcionalities \na friend is arquitect and i was showing her what AI can do \nand i got some images from thijs to help ideate with AI  a sample blender 3d scene",
   "starred": false,
   "media": {
    "mime": "image/jpeg",
    "path": "Media/WhatsApp Images/Sent/IMG-20260623-WA0043.jpg",
    "size": 221810,
    "duration_s": 0,
    "sha256_b64": "kKPwuSuuK0H2TCVLh4vWHNj++boLxKvJgfuBg3Bqvgo=",
    "media_name": null,
    "media_caption": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 1799381,
   "key_id": "3EB03EAEEBECD0F1FAFB23",
   "ts_ms": 1781061855000,
   "ts_iso": "2026-06-10T03:24:15+00:00",
   "from_me": true,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 1,
   "text": "this is v2 jasjajs  \nif you find it cool i can get the ideas of how you are paning the place and see to make 3d renders of it \n\nmight help to calculate the materials etc",
   "starred": false,
   "media": {
    "mime": "image/jpeg",
    "path": "Media/WhatsApp Images/Sent/IMG-20260623-WA0042.jpg",
    "size": 98882,
    "duration_s": 0,
    "sha256_b64": "YW1fZi45IPeYwdT3x8lglcsHx61hlISk8IbS4G8I8Jo=",
    "media_name": null,
    "media_caption": null
   }
  },
  {
   "id": 1802742,
   "key_id": "AC4141D698140C0F0DD7DF8FA718461E",
   "ts_ms": 1781199385642,
   "ts_iso": "2026-06-11T17:36:25.642000+00:00",
   "from_me": true,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 0,
   "text": "Hello do you by chance have plans and sketches of house ideas for the place ?",
   "starred": false
  },
  {
   "id": 1802745,
   "key_id": "AC780A33B71E0415FF61072CB3904203",
   "ts_ms": 1781199427062,
   "ts_iso": "2026-06-11T17:37:07.062000+00:00",
   "from_me": true,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 0,
   "text": "I'm checking online open data to see if we can get a Google earth style blender map of the place and put digital houses",
   "starred": false
  },
  {
   "id": 1802943,
   "key_id": "AC780BEABD8E561D3D19A4F25B8AE99F",
   "ts_ms": 1781205572000,
   "ts_iso": "2026-06-11T19:19:32+00:00",
   "from_me": false,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 0,
   "text": "Great to hear from you, and thanks for reaching out.\nI do have some ideas and reference photos that I can send you. Please keep in mind that nothing is final yet, as we are still developing the concept and making changes along the way. However, the photos should give you a good impression of the direction we would like to go.\nI really like the idea of creating a 3D model of the terrain and placing the houses digitally on the map. I think that could be very useful for visualizing the project and estimating materials.\nI will gather some photos and sketches and send them to you soon.\nThanks again for your help!\nKind regards,\nWesley",
   "starred": false
  },
  {
