   "from_me": true,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 0,
   "text": "Hello n.n\nHow are you?\n\nWould you be free any of this days to take a look on what we can do for you and what to do next ?\n\n/ If the research sofar is ok",
   "starred": false
  },
  {
