   "key_id": "ACED30E9BE1E744407B1932DDA4FF3C1",
   "ts_ms": 1783554942000,
   "ts_iso": "2026-07-08T23:55:42+00:00",
   "from_me": false,
   "sender_jid": null,
   "type": 0,
   "text": "Hey Ivan,\nHow are you doing?\nI haven't been on my phone or computer much lately because we've been working full speed on the house. Tomorrow morning I fly back to the Netherlands.\nUnfortunately, I only received the keys just before leaving, so I didn't have much time left to get everything done.\nLet's get in touch next week to discuss the quotations and the next steps for the project.\nI'll speak to you next week about it.\nThanks in advance, and talk to you soon!\nKind regards,\nWesley",
   "starred": false
  },
